{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BXdp4yg2vo1795710123.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>英倫銀行計劃下調英國銀行業資本要求，並警告環球金融體系風險增加。</p><p></p><p>英倫銀行發表半年度《金融穩定報告》，公布對銀行資本框架評估的最終細節，建議將英國整體銀行一級資本要求，下調0.3個百分點，至約百分之12.8。《彭博》預計，有關方案可釋放約1,000億英鎊借貸空間。</p><p></p><p>另外，英倫銀行指，全球借貸成本上升，中東衝突，以及人工智能超大規模企業，今年發債額預計逾3,000億美元，環球金融體系的風險進一步增加。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T17:04:24.300384+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T16:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T23:57:34.489019+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:57:39.145124+00:00","content_hash":"8590674119e44a43e7d3af94029842e2d4190db205b51903d2a92ec2b4dcaee5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T17:04:24.300384+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}